        <p style="margin: 0;"><strong>FAX:</strong> {!Sales_Order__c.Pathology_Lab__r.Fax}</p>
        <p style="margin: 0;"><strong>PHONE:</strong> {!Sales_Order__c.Pathology_Lab__r.Phone}</p>
        <p style="margin: 0;"><strong>SUBJECT:</strong> ArteraAI Prostate Test - Patient Slide Request Order # {!Sales_Order__c.Portal_Ticket__c}</p>

        <p style="margin-top: 20px;"><strong>COMMENTS:</strong> Hello, a clinician caring for a patient whose tissue specimen is at your lab has ordered an ArteraAI Prostate Test for their patient, kindly provide the following:</p>

        <p style="margin: 0;">Please send 1 (one) H&amp;E slide from Part {!Sales_Order__c.Highest_Gleason_Score_and_Part__c}, (Accession # / Case #) {!Sales_Order__c.Pathology_Ascension_Number__c}.</p>

        <p style="margin-top: 20px;">Please include the TRF and patient’s pathology report inside the Artera Kit (Kit will be delivered to your facility on or before {!TEXT(MONTH(TODAY() + 2)) + '/' + TEXT(DAY(TODAY() + 2)) + '/' + TEXT(YEAR(TODAY() + 2))}).</p>

