        Artera Inc<br/>
        6800 Southpoint Pkwy<br/>
        STE 950<br/>
        Jacksonville, FL 32216</p>

        <p style="margin-top: 20px;">If the H&amp;E Slide(s) are unavailable:</p>
        <ul style="margin-left: 20px;">
            <li>Please send an unexhausted block with a frozen ice pack in the Artera kit to prevent melting during shipping.</li>
        </ul>
